@startuml LivingDocs_2Level_Review_Sequence
autonumber
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 15
skinparam Shadowing true
skinparam RoundCorner 10

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2563EB
    ActorBorderColor #64748B
    LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    ParticipantBorderColor #475569
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
    ParticipantFontSize 12
    ParticipantFontColor #0F172A
}

title HỆ THỐNG LIVINGDOCS - TUẦN TỰ PHÊ DUYỆT 2 CẤP (STAFF & MANAGER)

actor "Staff\n«Reviewer»" as Staff #FEF3C7
actor "Manager\n«Approver»" as Manager #EDE9FE
boundary "ReviewController\n«REST API»" as Controller #E0F2FE
control "ReviewService\n«Application»" as Service #F1F5F9
entity "DocumentStateMachine\n«Domain Core»" as StateMachine #FEE2E2
control "AuditLogService\n«Port / Adapter»" as AuditService #E0E7FF
database "Database & GitHub\n«PostgreSQL / API»" as Database #DCFCE7

== GIAI ĐOẠN 1: STAFF RÀ SOÁT & DUYỆT CẤP 1 (UNDER_REVIEW_STAFF -> UNDER_REVIEW_MANAGER) ==

Staff -> Controller : GET /api/reviews/staff/queue
activate Controller
Controller -> Service : getStaffQueue()
activate Service
Service -> Database : findByStatus(UNDER_REVIEW_STAFF)
activate Database
Database --> Service : Danh sách tài liệu kèm Repo & Tác giả
deactivate Database
Service --> Controller : List<ReviewQueueItemResponse>
deactivate Service
Controller --> Staff : 200 OK (Hiển thị hàng đợi Staff)
deactivate Controller

Staff -> Controller : POST /api/reviews/{id}/staff-action\n{ decision: "APPROVE", comment: "AST hợp lệ" }
activate Controller
Controller -> Service : handleStaffAction(id, request, actorId, "STAFF")
activate Service
Service -> StateMachine : transition(UNDER_REVIEW_STAFF, UNDER_REVIEW_MANAGER, "STAFF")
activate StateMachine
StateMachine --> Service : Trạng thái mới hợp lệ (UNDER_REVIEW_MANAGER)
deactivate StateMachine

Service -> Database : documents.update(status = UNDER_REVIEW_MANAGER)
Service -> Database : reviews.save(record: APPROVED, comment)
Service -> AuditService : recordDocumentAction(actorId, docId,\nDOCUMENT_STAFF_REVIEWED, detail)
activate AuditService
AuditService -> Database : audit_logs.save(user_id, action, resource_type, detail)
deactivate AuditService

Service --> Controller : ReviewActionResponse
deactivate Service
Controller --> Staff : 200 OK (Duyệt Cấp 1 thành công -> Chuyển Manager)
deactivate Controller

== GIAI ĐOẠN 2: MANAGER PHÊ DUYỆT XUẤT BẢN CẤP 2 (UNDER_REVIEW_MANAGER -> PUBLISHED) ==

Manager -> Controller : GET /api/reviews/manager/queue
activate Controller
Controller -> Service : getManagerQueue()
activate Service
Service -> Database : findByStatus(UNDER_REVIEW_MANAGER) + lấy comment Staff
activate Database
Database --> Service : Danh sách tài liệu chờ ký duyệt
deactivate Database
Service --> Controller : List<ReviewQueueItemResponse>
deactivate Service
Controller --> Manager : 200 OK (Hiển thị tài liệu kèm nhận xét Staff)
deactivate Controller

Manager -> Controller : POST /api/reviews/{id}/manager-action\n{ decision: "PUBLISH", comment: "Đạt chuẩn xuất bản" }
activate Controller
Controller -> Service : handleManagerAction(id, request, actorId, "MANAGER")
activate Service
Service -> StateMachine : transition(UNDER_REVIEW_MANAGER, PUBLISHED, "MANAGER")
activate StateMachine
StateMachine --> Service : Trạng thái mới hợp lệ (PUBLISHED)
deactivate StateMachine

Service -> Database : gitHubClient.createOrUpdateFile(...) -> Nhận Commit SHA
Service -> Database : documents.update(status = PUBLISHED)
Service -> Database : reviews.save(record: PUBLISHED, comment)
Service -> AuditService : recordDocumentAction(actorId, docId,\nDOCUMENT_PUBLISHED, detail + commitSha)
activate AuditService
AuditService -> Database : audit_logs.save(user_id, action, resource_type, detail)
deactivate AuditService

Service --> Controller : ReviewActionResponse (status: PUBLISHED)
deactivate Service
Controller --> Manager : 200 OK (Xuất bản thành công + Commit SHA)
deactivate Controller

note over Staff, Database #F8FAFC
  <b>Nhánh rẽ thay thế:</b>
  • Manager chọn <b>RETURN_STAFF</b>: Trả về <code>UNDER_REVIEW_STAFF</code>, ghi log <code>DOCUMENT_RETURNED_STAFF</code>.
  • Staff / Manager chọn <b>REJECT</b>: Chuyển sang <code>REJECTED</code>, ghi log <code>DOCUMENT_REJECTED</code> kèm lý do.
end note

@enduml
